      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This commentary refutes published assertions that opioid use is inherently dangerous and to be discouraged. A reasoned case for risk-to-benefit considerations is presented. Data from federal reporting systems are placed in perspective. The importance of using opioids rationally in pain management is supported."},
